  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kenya Catalytic Jobs Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Kenya Catalytic Jobs Fund will test innovations that have the potential for large-scale job creation, unlocking barriers in key productive sectors and/or generating employment for those that are most vulnerable  e.g. youth living with disability. The programme will focus particularly on youth and through a flexible fund, it will provide a mix of technical assistance and grant support to innovations with the aim to generatre evidence on what works and what doesn&apos;t in creating jobs.</narrative>
  </description>
